# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=xkeyboard-config
pkgver=2.44
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Keyboard layouts for every language (the XKB data)"
arch=(any)
url="https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/XKeyboardConfig/"
license=(LicenseRef-xkeyboard-config)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/data/xkeyboard-config/xkeyboard-config-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    meson setup xkeyboard-config-$pkgver build --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release \
        -D xorg-rules-symlinks=true
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
